@Dogecoin Whales Are Restocking Ahead of a Potential Rally.

@Santiment analysts have recorded an increase in the number of wallets with a balance of at least 1 million DOGE.

The number of active addresses has reached a four-month high, hinting at an imminent surge in Dogecoin. https://t.co/11wT5VswmT

@IBKR adds support for new cryptocurrencies.

Brokerage firm Interactive Brokers has expanded its list of available digital assets by adding Solana, Cardano, XRP, and Dogecoin.

Previously, platform clients already had access to Bitcoin, Ethereum, Litecoin, and Bitcoin Cash. https://t.co/FEthYPIM6v

@SECGov delays decisions on XRP and DOGE ETFs.

The SEC has postponed decisions on spot ETF applications for XRP and Dogecoin submitted by @21Shares and @Grayscale.

